TITLE_ZH = "圖型識別 第四章 KP09：代價函數的選擇（大三）"; TITLE_EN = "Pattern Recognition, Chapter 4, KP09: choosing the cost function (undergraduate)"
NOTE_ZH = "教材程度：大學三年級（undergrad）。依講義 lec05-kp09 以 view-from-text-v3 製作：先規劃頁面，每頁以一張原生資訊圖（HTML 設計後轉成原生節點）為主，名詞在同一頁圖內定義。共 10 頁，所有數字皆由程式計算。"
NOTE_EN = "Level: undergraduate (year 3). Made from the lecture lec05-kp09 with view-from-text-v3: pages were planned first and each page is mainly one native infographic (designed in HTML and converted to native nodes), with the terms defined on the same page. 10 pages; every number is computed by program."
def fig(n, alt_zh, alt_en):
    return lambda: native(f"kp09_p{n}", f"lec05-kp09-p{n}", KP.W, KP.H, JD, alt_en if os.environ.get("KP_LANG") == "en" else alt_zh)
P = []
NXT = {1: ("高原", "the plateau"), 2: ("交叉熵", "cross-entropy"), 3: ("訓練對比", "the training comparison"), 4: ("概似", "likelihood"), 5: ("softmax", "softmax"), 6: ("判別式學習", "discriminative learning"), 7: ("貝氏訓練", "Bayesian training"), 8: ("起點越錯", "the worse the start"), 9: ("小練習", "the exercises")}
PREV = {2: ("平方誤差的兩個毛病", "the two faults of the squared error"), 3: ("高原", "the plateau"), 4: ("交叉熵", "cross-entropy"), 5: ("訓練對比", "the training comparison"), 6: ("概似", "likelihood"), 7: ("softmax", "softmax"), 8: ("判別式學習", "discriminative learning"), 9: ("貝氏訓練", "Bayesian training"), 10: ("起點越錯", "the worse the start")}
def add(n, lab, title, bridge, notes, alt):
    zh, en = notes
    if n in PREV: zh = f"承接上一頁的「{PREV[n][0]}」。" + zh; en = f"Following the previous page on {PREV[n][1]}. " + en
    if n == 10: zh += "到這裡這個單元就結束了；之後請接著讀下一單元。"; en += " That ends this unit; next, move on to the next unit."
    if n in NXT: zh += f"接下來的下一頁是「{NXT[n][0]}」。"; en += f" Next, the next page covers {NXT[n][1]}."
    P.append(dict(lab=lab, title=title, bridge=bridge, notes=(zh, en), layout="freeform", spec=fig(n, *alt)))
add(1, ("兩個毛病", "Two faults"),
    ("平方誤差有兩個毛病：大誤差主導學習，輸出錯到極端時損失只有 0.499", "The squared error has two faults: large errors dominate, and at the extreme the loss is only 0.499"),
    ("KP08 的加速都在改更新式，但更新往哪裡走取決於代價函數本身。平方誤差是唯一的選擇嗎？", "The speed-ups of KP08 all change the update rule, but where the update goes depends on the cost function itself. Is the squared error the only choice?"),
    ("這是 KP09 的第一頁。先備三件事：sigmoid 與反向傳播的 δ（KP06）、機率與 ln 把乘積變成加總、貝氏定理（第二章）。平方誤差有兩個毛病。不公平：誤差先平方再加總，大誤差主導學習，誤差 0.9 與 0.1 差 9 倍，平方後是 0.81 與 0.01，差 81 倍。會卡住：輸出錯到極端，目標 1、輸出 0.001 時，平方誤差只有 0.499，不會再變大，梯度下降可能被困住；對照另一種損失負 ln ŷ，在 ŷ 等於 0.001 時是 6.908（程式計算）。",
     "This is the first page of KP09. Prerequisites: the sigmoid and the backpropagation δ (KP06), probability with ln turning a product into a sum, and Bayes' theorem (chapter 2). The squared error has two faults. It is unfair: errors are squared before they are summed, so large errors dominate; errors of 0.9 and 0.1 differ 9 times, but squared they are 0.81 and 0.01, which differ 81 times. It gets stuck: at the extreme, target 1 and output 0.001, the squared error is only 0.499 and stops growing, so gradient descent can get stuck; the other loss, minus ln ŷ, is 6.908 at ŷ equal to 0.001 (computed by program)."),
    ("Left: for target 1 the squared error 1/2(1-yhat)^2 reaches only 0.499 at yhat=0.001 while -ln yhat reaches 6.908; right: the two faults, unfair (0.81 vs 0.01) and getting stuck.",) * 2)
add(2, ("高原", "Plateau"),
    ("高原：輸出錯在極端時 δ 趨近 0，net = −10 時平方誤差的 δ 只有 0.000045", "Plateau: when the output is extremely wrong δ approaches 0, only 0.000045 at net = −10"),
    ("平方誤差在輸出 0.001 時只有 0.499，不會再變大，梯度下降可能被困住。輸出錯到極端時，δ 到底有多小？", "At output 0.001 the squared error is only 0.499 and stops growing, so gradient descent can get stuck. How small is δ when the output is that wrong?"),
    ("這一頁看 δ 有多小。高原是代價很大、梯度卻幾乎為 0 的平坦區，梯度下降在上面幾乎不動。單一 sigmoid 輸出的平方誤差，δ 等於 (y 減 ŷ) 乘 ŷ 乘 (1 減 ŷ)；ŷ 越接近 0 或 1，斜率 ŷ(1 減 ŷ) 越小，把大誤差也壓成小訊號。目標 y 等於 1、net 等於負 10 時，ŷ 等於 0.000045，誤差近 1，δ 只有 0.000045；曲線只有中間一小段夠大，兩側都是高原（程式計算）。",
     "This page shows how small δ gets. A plateau is a flat region where the cost is large but the gradient is almost 0, so gradient descent hardly moves on it. For a single sigmoid output with squared error, δ equals (y minus ŷ) times ŷ times (1 minus ŷ); the closer ŷ is to 0 or 1, the smaller the slope ŷ(1 minus ŷ), which squeezes even a large error into a small signal. With target y equal to 1 and net equal to minus 10, ŷ is 0.000045, the error is near 1 and δ is only 0.000045; only a small middle stretch of the curve is large and both sides are plateaus (computed by program)."),
    ("Squared-error delta against net for target 1: a bump near 0 and plateaus on both sides; at net=-10, yhat=0.000045 and delta=0.000045.",) * 2)
add(3, ("交叉熵", "Cross-entropy"),
    ("交叉熵把斜率約掉：δ = y − ŷ，net = −10 時 δ = 1.0000，平方誤差只有 0.00005", "Cross-entropy cancels the slope: δ = y − ŷ, 1.0000 at net = −10 against 0.00005 for squared error"),
    ("高原讓平方誤差的 δ 在 net = −10 時只有 0.000045。能不能換一個代價，把這個壓低的斜率約掉？", "On the plateau the squared-error δ is only 0.000045 at net = −10. Can another cost cancel this squeezed slope?"),
    ("這一頁換成交叉熵。交叉熵把輸出 ŷ 當成目標為 1 的機率，J 等於負的 (y ln ŷ 加 (1 減 y) ln (1 減 ŷ))，y 等於 1 時是負 ln ŷ。推導一步一步來：一，J 對 ŷ 的偏微分是負的 (y 減 ŷ) 除以 ŷ(1 減 ŷ)；二，sigmoid 的斜率是 ŷ(1 減 ŷ)；三，連鎖律相乘，ŷ(1 減 ŷ) 剛好約掉，δ 等於 y 減 ŷ。符號沿用 KP06，來源寫成 ŷ 減 y，差一個負號。右邊是 y 等於 1 時的對照表：net 為負 10、負 5、負 2、0、2、5，平方誤差的 δ 是 0.00005、0.00660、0.09248、0.12500、0.01252、0.00004，交叉熵的 δ 是 1.0000、0.9933、0.8808、0.5000、0.1192、0.0067（程式計算）。",
     "This page switches to the cross-entropy. The cross-entropy treats the output ŷ as the probability that the target is 1: J equals minus (y ln ŷ plus (1 minus y) ln (1 minus ŷ)), which for y equal to 1 is minus ln ŷ. The derivation, step by step: one, the partial derivative of J with respect to ŷ is minus (y minus ŷ) over ŷ(1 minus ŷ); two, the sigmoid slope is ŷ(1 minus ŷ); three, multiplying by the chain rule, ŷ(1 minus ŷ) cancels exactly and δ equals y minus ŷ. The sign follows KP06; the source writes ŷ minus y, a sign apart. On the right is the comparison for y equal to 1: for net equal to minus 10, minus 5, minus 2, 0, 2, 5 the squared-error δ is 0.00005, 0.00660, 0.09248, 0.12500, 0.01252, 0.00004 and the cross-entropy δ is 1.0000, 0.9933, 0.8808, 0.5000, 0.1192, 0.0067 (computed by program)."),
    ("Three derivation steps for cross-entropy and the table of delta for net=-10..5: squared 0.00005, 0.00660, 0.09248, 0.12500, 0.01252, 0.00004 vs cross-entropy 1.0000, 0.9933, 0.8808, 0.5000, 0.1192, 0.0067.",) * 2)
add(4, ("訓練對比", "Training comparison"),
    ("訓練對比：交叉熵 5 個 epoch 四點全對，平方誤差要 85 個", "Training comparison: cross-entropy gets all four points right in 5 epochs, the squared error needs 85"),
    ("交叉熵的 δ 在 net = −10 時是 1.0000，不被壓小；平方誤差只有 0.00005。這在訓練上差多少？", "The cross-entropy δ is 1.0000 at net = −10, not squeezed, while the squared error has 0.00005. How much does that matter in training?"),
    ("這一頁比訓練。實驗設定是本講義設計、程式實作：一個 sigmoid 神經元 ŷ 等於 σ(b 加 wx)，四點 x 等於負 2、負 1、1、2，目標 0、0、1、1；起點 w 等於負 3、b 等於 0，四點全錯；η 等於 0.5，批次更新，每個 epoch 用四點的平均 δ；全對是 ŷ 大於 0.5 與目標一致的點數為 4。結果：交叉熵 5 個 epoch 四點全對，平方誤差要 85 個。常見迷思是換了交叉熵才分得對；其實兩種代價最後都能分對，差別是起點很錯時的速度（程式計算）。",
     "This page compares training. The setup is my own design, implemented in a program: one sigmoid neuron ŷ equal to σ(b plus wx), four points x equal to minus 2, minus 1, 1, 2 with targets 0, 0, 1, 1; the start is w equal to minus 3 and b equal to 0, all four wrong; η equals 0.5 with batch updates using the mean δ of the four points per epoch; all right means that the number of points where ŷ above 0.5 agrees with the target is 4. Result: cross-entropy gets all four right in 5 epochs and the squared error needs 85. The common myth is that only the cross-entropy gets it right; in fact both costs end up right, and the difference is the speed from a badly wrong start (computed by program)."),
    ("Output of the neuron at x=2 against epoch: cross-entropy passes 0.5 at epoch 5, squared error at epoch 85; setup with four points, start w=-3, eta=0.5.",) * 2)
add(5, ("概似", "Likelihood"),
    ("交叉熵就是負對數概似：四筆機率相乘 0.4536，−ln 0.4536 = 0.7905，與四筆交叉熵加總相同", "Cross-entropy is negative log-likelihood: probabilities multiply to 0.4536, −ln 0.4536 = 0.7905"),
    ("交叉熵 5 個 epoch 就讓四點全對，平方誤差要 85 個。交叉熵為什麼是對的代價？", "Cross-entropy gets all four points right in 5 epochs, the squared error needs 85. Why is cross-entropy the right cost?"),
    ("這一頁說明交叉熵為什麼是對的代價。概似是假設模型是對的，觀察到這批資料的機率，越大越好，獨立的各筆機率相乘。例子：輸出 0.9、0.8、0.3、0.1，目標 1、1、0、0。各筆目標的機率是 0.9、0.8、1 減 0.3 等於 0.7、1 減 0.1 等於 0.9；相乘 0.9 乘 0.8 乘 0.7 乘 0.9 等於 0.4536，負 ln 0.4536 等於 0.7905；四筆交叉熵 0.105、0.223、0.357、0.105 加總也是 0.7905，相同。所以最小化交叉熵就是最大化概似（程式計算）。",
     "This page explains why the cross-entropy is the right cost. The likelihood is the probability of observing this data if the model is right; larger is better, and independent samples multiply. Example: outputs 0.9, 0.8, 0.3, 0.1 with targets 1, 1, 0, 0. The probabilities of the targets are 0.9, 0.8, 1 minus 0.3 equal to 0.7, and 1 minus 0.1 equal to 0.9; the product 0.9 times 0.8 times 0.7 times 0.9 is 0.4536 and minus ln 0.4536 is 0.7905; the four cross-entropies 0.105, 0.223, 0.357, 0.105 also sum to 0.7905, the same. So minimizing the cross-entropy is maximizing the likelihood (computed by program)."),
    ("Four samples with outputs 0.9,0.8,0.3,0.1 and targets 1,1,0,0: target probabilities 0.9,0.8,0.7,0.9 multiply to 0.4536, -ln = 0.7905, equal to the sum of the cross-entropies 0.105+0.223+0.357+0.105.",) * 2)
add(6, ("softmax", "softmax"),
    ("softmax 用於多類別：v = (2, 1, 0.1) 得 ŷ = (0.659, 0.242, 0.099)，δ = y − ŷ = (0.341, −0.242, −0.099)", "softmax: v = (2, 1, 0.1) gives ŷ = (0.659, 0.242, 0.099) and δ = y − ŷ = (0.341, −0.242, −0.099)"),
    ("最小化交叉熵就是最大化概似，四筆機率相乘 0.4536。類別不只兩個時，輸出怎麼做？", "Minimizing the cross-entropy is maximizing the likelihood, and the four probabilities multiply to 0.4536. How do we build the output when there are more than two classes?"),
    ("這一頁處理多類別。softmax 用於多類別：ŷk 等於 e 的 vk 次方除以所有 e 的 vk' 次方的總和，輸出都在 0 與 1 之間，加總恰為 1。例子 v 等於 (2, 1, 0.1)：e 的 2 次方 7.389、e 的 1 次方 2.718、e 的 0.1 次方 1.105，總和 11.212；ŷ 等於 (0.659, 0.242, 0.099)。目標 y 等於 (1, 0, 0)：J 等於負 ln 0.659 等於 0.417。反向傳播需要的 δk 等於 yk 減 ŷk 等於 (0.341, 負 0.242, 負 0.099)，與數值差分相同（程式驗證）。",
     "This page handles several classes. The softmax is used for several classes: ŷk equals e to the vk over the sum of e to the vk', every output lies between 0 and 1 and they sum to exactly 1. Example with v equal to (2, 1, 0.1): e squared is 7.389, e to the 1 is 2.718 and e to the 0.1 is 1.105, total 11.212; ŷ equals (0.659, 0.242, 0.099). With target y equal to (1, 0, 0): J equals minus ln 0.659, which is 0.417. The δk needed by backpropagation equals yk minus ŷk, that is (0.341, minus 0.242, minus 0.099), the same as numerical differences (checked by program)."),
    ("Bars for v=(2,1,0.1), softmax output (0.659,0.242,0.099) and delta (0.341,-0.242,-0.099); J = 0.417.",) * 2)
add(7, ("判別式學習", "Discriminative learning"),
    ("判別式學習：離群點 x = 40 讓平方誤差的切點在 1.40，把 x = 1 分錯；交叉熵切在 0，七點全對", "The outlier x = 40 moves the squared-error cut to 1.40 (x = 1 wrong); cross-entropy cuts at 0"),
    ("softmax 用於多類別，δ = y − ŷ 一樣乾淨。代價函數的選擇，如何影響決策邊界？", "softmax: v = (2, 1, 0.1) gives ŷ = (0.659, 0.242, 0.099) and δ = y − ŷ, clean also for several classes. How does the choice of cost function affect the decision boundary?"),
    ("這一頁看判別式學習：既然目標是降低分類錯誤率，就直接把重心放在最大的後驗機率上，推動決策面去降低錯誤。對照例是本講義設計、程式實作：x 等於負 3、負 2、負 1 為類 0，x 等於 1、2、3 與離群點 x 等於 40 為類 1。平方誤差用最小平方直線 y 約等於 ax 加 b，a 等於 0.0165、b 等於 0.477，在直線等於 0.5 處切，切點 1.40，x 等於 1 被分錯。交叉熵用一個 sigmoid 輸出，梯度下降起點 0、η 等於 0.5、20000 輪，切點約 0，七點全對。這個對照同時換了輸出與代價；錯誤率本身不可微，要用平滑版，有區域極小值的風險（程式計算）。",
     "This page looks at discriminative learning: since the goal is to lower the classification error, put the focus directly on the largest posterior probability and push the decision surface to reduce the errors. The contrast example is my own design, implemented in a program: x equal to minus 3, minus 2, minus 1 are class 0, and x equal to 1, 2, 3 plus the outlier x equal to 40 are class 1. For the squared error use the least-squares line y approximately a x plus b with a equal to 0.0165 and b equal to 0.477 and cut where the line equals 0.5, at 1.40, so x equal to 1 is misclassified. For the cross-entropy use one sigmoid output with gradient descent from 0, η equal to 0.5 and 20000 rounds; the cut is near 0 and all seven are right. The contrast changes both the output and the cost; the error rate itself is not differentiable, so a smooth version is used, with the risk of local minima (computed by program)."),
    ("Left: seven points with the outlier x=40 flattening the least-squares line; right: zoom -4..4 with the squared-error cut at 1.40 (x=1 wrong) and the cross-entropy cut near 0.",) * 2)
add(8, ("貝氏訓練", "Bayesian training"),
    ("貝氏訓練：資料越多，後驗越窄，標準差從 2 降到 0.222，平均從 0 移向 1.48", "Bayesian training: more data narrows the posterior, sd from 2 to 0.222 and mean from 0 to 1.48"),
    ("判別式學習中，離群點讓平方誤差的切點移到 1.40，交叉熵切在 0。如果連權重也當成不確定的呢？", "In discriminative learning the outlier moved the squared-error cut to 1.40 while cross-entropy cut at 0. What if the weights themselves are treated as uncertain?"),
    ("這一頁看貝氏訓練：先設權重的先驗分布 p(w)，資料進場後用貝氏定理得到後驗 p(w 給定 Y) 等於 p(Y 給定 w) 乘 p(w) 除以 p(Y)；分類時對所有 w 平均，積分 φk(x; w) 乘後驗。例子是本講義設計、高斯公式算出：先驗 w 服從 N(0, 2 平方)；每筆資料都說 w 約等於 1.5，雜訊標準差 1；n 筆資料。後驗精度，也就是變異的倒數，等於 1/4 加 n，後驗平均等於 1.5n 除以 (1/4 加 n)。n 為 0、1、5、20 時，後驗標準差是 2、0.894、0.436、0.222，後驗平均是 0、1.2、1.43、1.48。代價是高維積分很貴；來源提醒，實務上換掉最小平方未必帶來實質提升（程式計算）。",
     "This page looks at Bayesian training: put a prior p(w) on the weights, and when data arrive Bayes' theorem gives the posterior p(w given Y) equal to p(Y given w) times p(w) over p(Y); when classifying, average over all w, the integral of φk(x; w) times the posterior. The example is my own design, computed with Gaussian formulas: prior w follows N(0, 2 squared); every sample says w is about 1.5 with noise standard deviation 1; n samples. The posterior precision, the inverse of the variance, equals 1/4 plus n and the posterior mean equals 1.5n over (1/4 plus n). For n equal to 0, 1, 5, 20 the posterior standard deviation is 2, 0.894, 0.436, 0.222 and the posterior mean is 0, 1.2, 1.43, 1.48. The price is that high-dimensional integrals are expensive; the source warns that in practice replacing least squares does not necessarily bring a real improvement (computed by program)."),
    ("Posterior densities of w for n=0,1,5,20: sd 2, 0.894, 0.436, 0.222 and mean 0, 1.2, 1.43, 1.48; prior N(0, 2^2) and data saying w about 1.5.",) * 2)
add(9, ("起點越錯", "Worse starts"),
    ("起點越錯差距越大：w = −10 時平方誤差要 88,141 個 epoch，交叉熵只要 14 個", "Worse starts widen the gap: at w = −10 the squared error needs 88,141 epochs, cross-entropy 14"),
    ("貝氏訓練讓後驗隨資料變窄，代價是高維積分很貴。回到訓練速度：起點越錯，兩種代價的差距會怎麼變？", "Bayesian training narrows the posterior with data at the price of expensive high-dimensional integrals. Back to training speed: how does the gap between the two costs change as the start gets worse?"),
    ("這是延伸：起點越錯。同第 4 頁的資料與 η 等於 0.5、b 等於 0，起點 w 為負 1、負 2、負 3、負 4、負 6、負 8、負 10 時，平方誤差所需 epoch 數是 11、31、85、227、1631、11950、88141；交叉熵是 2、4、5、6、9、12、14。平方誤差的 δ 隨起點變錯而指數縮小，epoch 數大致指數增加；交叉熵的 δ 保持在 1 附近，所需 epoch 數幾乎平躺。兩種代價最後都能分對，差別是起點很錯時的速度（程式計算）。",
     "This is the extension: the worse the start. With the data of page 4, η equal to 0.5 and b equal to 0, for start w equal to minus 1, minus 2, minus 3, minus 4, minus 6, minus 8, minus 10 the squared error needs 11, 31, 85, 227, 1631, 11950, 88141 epochs and the cross-entropy needs 2, 4, 5, 6, 9, 12, 14. The squared-error δ shrinks exponentially as the start gets worse, so its epoch count grows roughly exponentially; the cross-entropy δ stays near 1 and its epoch count is almost flat. Both costs end up right and the difference is the speed from a badly wrong start (computed by program)."),
    ("Epochs needed against start w on a log scale: squared error 11, 31, 85, 227, 1631, 11950, 88141; cross-entropy 2, 4, 5, 6, 9, 12, 14 for w=-1,-2,-3,-4,-6,-8,-10.",) * 2)
add(10, ("小練習", "Exercises"),
    ("兩題小練習：net = −4 時 ŷ = 0.0180，交叉熵的 δ 是平方誤差的 56.6 倍", "Two exercises: at net = −4, ŷ = 0.0180 and the cross-entropy δ is 56.6 times the squared-error one"),
    ("起點越錯，平方誤差的 δ 指數縮小，交叉熵的 δ 保持在 1 附近。用 net = −4 算一次，交叉熵的 δ 是平方誤差的幾倍？", "The worse the start, the more the squared-error δ shrinks while the cross-entropy δ stays near 1. At net = −4, how many times larger is the cross-entropy δ?"),
    ("兩題小練習：單一 sigmoid 輸出，目標 1，net 等於負 4。題 1：ŷ 等於 σ(負 4) 等於 1 除以 (1 加 e 的 4 次方) 等於 0.0180。題 2：平方誤差 δ 等於 0.9820 乘 0.0180 乘 0.9820 等於 0.01735；交叉熵 δ 等於 1 減 ŷ 等於 0.9820；倍數 0.9820 除以 0.01735 等於 56.6。核對：倍數就是 1 除以 ŷ(1 減 ŷ)，輸出越極端越大；net 等於負 10 時約 22000 倍（程式計算）。",
     "Two exercises: a single sigmoid output, target 1, net equal to minus 4. Q1: ŷ equals σ(minus 4), which is 1 over (1 plus e to the 4th) and equals 0.0180. Q2: the squared-error δ equals 0.9820 times 0.0180 times 0.9820, which is 0.01735; the cross-entropy δ equals 1 minus ŷ, which is 0.9820; the ratio 0.9820 over 0.01735 is 56.6. Check: the ratio is 1 over ŷ(1 minus ŷ), larger when the output is more extreme; about 22000 at net equal to minus 10 (computed by program)."),
    ("Exercise 1: sigma(-4)=0.0180. Exercise 2: squared delta 0.01735, cross-entropy delta 0.9820, ratio 56.6.",) * 2)
